NEW REQUIREMENT — HIGH PRIORITY.

The Founder must be able to request ERP changes directly from inside the ERP application using natural language in Bangla or English.

The long-term objective is to avoid repeatedly copying large prompts into an external AI coding interface for routine changes.

However, the AI Change Studio must be built as a secure, approval-controlled development workflow — not merely an AI chat box.

